# First blessing approved by the maintainer on 2026-10-29 for #1795.
# metering-charge-requests: an invalid amount is refused at enqueue with no
# request id. r1's q1 is accepted and spent
# without a Stretch; r2's q2 is more than its Run has left, so r2 faults at
# its call. After r1's answer, q3 is inactive and spends nothing.

